{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/597832-wraiths-creating-glens","id":597832,"title":"Wraiths creating Glens?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-20T21:27:23-07:00","id":597832,"title":"Wraiths creating Glens?","content":"I wasn't sure where to put this, so I will just put this here. Wraiths, via Pandemonium, can draw upon the Wyld to power that specific Arcanos. If you had, say, a few dozen Wraiths who were getting regular investments of Pathos and were being Castigated regularly, would they be able to cultivate a Glen, a Wyld tainted land, through repeated uses of the Pandemonium Art as well as constantly materializing for the ones who have been sufficiently mutated by their frequent contact with the Wyld? <br /> <br /> If not, what sort of things might happen from constant exposure to Wraith Wyld-Spirits constantly channeling their Pathos and Corpus into Wyld energy in a single spot over an extended period of time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T21:55:36-07:00","id":597871,"title":"","content":"Glens aren't Wyld-tainted lands, at least if you're talking about Umbral Glens. Those are Gaian. Wyld energy alone won't make them. It could potentially make a Threshold or Abcess, where weird shit happens and reality breaks down. Note that even Black Furies and Red Talons generally think of Thresholds and Abcesses as bad news and will take steps to eliminate them if they show up in a caern.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T22:13:25-07:00","id":597881,"title":"","content":"Really? I thought that Black Furies were constantly on the lookout for places that could be converted into a Caern dedicated to the Wyld. Also, the book said that it is a breeding ground for Wyld spirits. And don't the Garou try to prevent the Wyld from going extinct? Isn't this a way of buying the Wyld more time?<br /> <br /> Edit: Nevermind, I just read they are called Wyldings. Still, Wyldings are probably important, in their own ways.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","user":"Mercurial","date":". 07-21-2015, 03:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-21T02:42:11-07:00","id":598084,"title":"","content":"Wyld does not need saving. It's an immense, titanic, endless power that will exist long after everything else is gone. It's primordial creation, whim, origin, evolution ad change. It exists only to create new things without any care for wha tit might do or how long it might exist. While you can embrace certain values and ascribe to the wisdom you can glean from the Wyld, you do not want to take it into you and yours. The same applies to the Glass Walkers and the Weaver, btw.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}